## P2P Economy Integration

```python
def activate_swarm_economy():
    """Activate P2P economy through swarm."""
    # No central authority
    # Resources flow to weakest nodes
    # Intent amplitude determines priority
    
    swarm = form_swarm(collect_intents())
    
    while swarm.active:
        # Redistribute resources
        redistribute_resources(swarm)
        
        # Check for materialization
        if swarm.knot.strength > THRESHOLD:
            crystal = swarm.knot.materialize()
            print(f"💎 Crystal materialized: {crystal.id}")
            break
        
        # Continue resonance
        swarm.resonate()
    
    # Dissolve and enrich
    swarm.dissolve()
